{
  "video_id": "yZCeJ7OJWyc",
  "title": "15 free Google AI tools to boost marketing, design, coding, and image #AItools #GoogleAI #Tech",
  "description": "Google has introduced 15 free AI tools designed to enhance productivity across marketing, design, coding, and workflow automation. These tools leverage AI to simplify and accelerate tasks that typically require extensive time and monetary investment. Key examples include Pomeli, which automatically creates social media content from a website link, and Stitch, which transforms simple prompts into stylish UI designs for apps and websites. Google Opal enables users to build AI-driven workflows akin to platforms like N8N and Make.com through integrated Google models. Additional offerings include Antigravity, an AI-powered code editor optimized for smooth coding experiences, and Mixport, a creative tool that combines AI-generated images in a collage-style environment similar to Canva and Pinterest. These tools collectively address different stages of digital creation, making advanced AI capabilities accessible and cost-effective for businesses and individual users. Their free availability, diverse applications, and user-friendly interfaces contribute to their broad appeal and viral potential. #GoogleAI #AITools #FreeAITools\n#MarketingAI #UIDesign #AIWorkflow #AICoding #AIContentCreation #CreativeAI #SocialMediaMarketing #AIEditors #AIImageGeneration #TechInnovation #ProductivityTools #DigitalTransformation #SmallBusinessAI",
